<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Tosco, Sun cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Tosco, Sun cut.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jefferies &amp; Co Inc downgraded Tosco Corp and Sun Co Inc to hold from accumulate.</p>
<p>- Jefferies said it cut ratings on views both stocks are fully priced.</p>
<p>- Also, recent weakness in California refining margins, if sustained, could result in negative earnings surprises for Tosco, Jefferies said.</p>
</text>
